{"id":"nach","lemma":"nach","pos":"prep","rank":55,"glosses":["after, past (later in time)","after, behind (in sequence)","to, towards (with geographical names, directions etc.; see usage notes below)"],"ipa":"/naːx/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f5/De-nach.ogg/De-nach.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Suchen Sie nach mir?","en":"Are you looking for me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758005","words":[{"g":"to search, to look for"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Kann ich jetzt nach Hause gehen?","en":"Can I go home now?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394757","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"now"},null,{"g":"to dwell, to reside","l":"hausen"},{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Wir gehen nach dem Essen.","en":"We'll go after we eat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755966","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go, to walk"},null,{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"to eat"}]},{"text":"Ich suche nach meinem Hund.","en":"I'm looking for my dog.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698692","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to search, to look for","l":"suchen"},null,{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"dog, hound"}]},{"text":"Sie kommt nach ihrer Mutter.","en":"She takes after her mother.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700944","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"she","l":"sie"},{"g":"mother"}]}]}